.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct nvme_exported_port_list" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct nvme_exported_port_list \- Exported Ports List Data Structure, returned by the Manage Exported NVM Subsystem Receive command's List Exported Ports management operation (memory-based transports only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct nvme_exported_port_list {
.br
.BI "    __le16 n;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 rsvd2[6];"
.br
.BI "    struct nvme_exported_port_descriptor entries[];"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "n" 12
Number of Exported Ports (N)
.IP "rsvd2" 12
Reserved
.IP "entries" 12
Exported Port Descriptor list, see \fIstruct
nvme_exported_port_descriptor\fP
